Bind Npc 14202 Zone 2
Quest 244 "[Repeatable] Fruit of Asga"
    Repeat always
    Journal "[Secret Agent] Clarence has commissioned you to recover the Fruit of Asga that has been stolen by the Cardinals."
    Collect 1 of 910082000

Requires player level >= 55 and player is elmorad

Rewards
    Give 10000 coins

On offer
    Say "For a long time, us rogues have been offering the valuable berries to the Imperial Family."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "But cardinals living in the vicinity stole all the Asga berries and there's nothing to present to the Imperial Family. Please help us and retrieve the berries."

On in_progress
    Say "Asga berries can be obtained by hunting cardinals."

On ready
    Say "Master, the Asga berries have been retrieved. Go back to [Secret Agent] Clarence now."
    Topic "Confirm" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "You brought Asga berries? I will give you a small gift for them."
